msgstr "操作失敗"

msgid "Extras"
msgstr "輔助功能"

msgid "About"
msgstr "關於"

msgid "Plugin %s · Core %s"
msgstr "外掛 %s · 核心 %s"

msgid "Open Source"
msgstr "開源"

msgid "This project is open source under the GPL-3.0 license. Source code, issues and release notes are on GitHub:"
msgstr "本專案以 GPL-3.0 授權開源，原始碼、問題回報與更新紀錄都在 GitHub："

msgid "View on GitHub"
msgstr "在 GitHub 上查看"

msgid "Acknowledgements"
msgstr "致謝"

msgid "MeowX for OpenWrt is built on %s. Its transparent proxy, mixin and service scripts all come from it. Many thanks to the nikki project and its authors."
msgstr "MeowX OpenWrt 版基於 %s 改造，透明代理、設定混入與服務腳本都來自它。衷心感謝 nikki 專案及其作者。"

msgid "The core is the MeowX fork of %s (source in %s), adding protocols such as Miu that upstream mihomo does not have."
msgstr "核心是 %s 的 MeowX 分支（原始碼在 %s），加入了 Miu 等官方 mihomo 沒有的協定。"

msgid "Checking for updates…"
msgstr "正在檢查更新…"

msgid "Unable to check for updates"
msgstr "檢查更新失敗"

msgid "You are on the latest version"
msgstr "已是最新版本"

msgid "New version %s available"
msgstr "有新版本 %s"

msgid "Update to %s"
msgstr "更新到 %s"

msgid "Update MeowX to %s? The page may be briefly unavailable while it installs; settings and subscriptions are kept."
msgstr "更新 MeowX 到 %s？安裝期間頁面可能短暫打不開，設定與訂閱都會保留。"

msgid "Updated to %s, reloading the page…"
msgstr "已更新到 %s，正在重新整理頁面…"

msgid "No output"
msgstr "沒有輸出"

msgid "The core is not running, so the web dashboard cannot be updated. Start the service first."
msgstr "核心沒有執行，無法更新 Web 面板，請先啟動服務。"

msgid "Web dashboard updated"
msgstr "Web 面板已更新"

msgid "Failed to update the web dashboard: %s"
msgstr "Web 面板更新失敗：%s"

msgid "no response from the core"
msgstr "核心沒有回應"

msgid "Subscriptions in your panel account"
msgstr "帳戶下的訂閱"

msgid "Import"
msgstr "匯入"


msgid "The core is not running. Choose a subscription and start the service first."
msgstr "核心沒有執行：先在訂閱卡選好訂閱並啟動服務。"

msgid "The running config has no external controller, so the web dashboard is unavailable. Fill in the API listen address under Mixin Config → External Control Config, then reload the service."
msgstr "目前執行的設定裡沒有外部控制埠，Web 面板用不了：在「混入設定 → 外部控制設定」裡填好 API 監聽位址，然後重載服務。"

msgid "Failed to download the web dashboard: %s"
msgstr "Web 面板下載失敗：%s"

msgid "Core only: the core runs, but router and LAN traffic is not taken over. Turn off \"Core Only\" below and save to start the transparent proxy."
msgstr "僅核心：只執行核心，不接管路由器和區域網路的流量。要讓區域網路裝置走代理，在下面關掉「僅核心」並儲存。"
